### 东信和平拣货上传接口测试
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8090

### 1. 成功上传-单条明细
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV202604010001",
  "userId": "USER001",
  "userName": "张三",
  "updateTime": 1648195200000,
  "details": [
    {
      "id": "DTL001",
      "materialCode": "MAT001",
      "batchNo": "B20260325",
      "locationCode": "A-01-02",
      "planQuantity": 100,
      "actualQuantity": 0,
      "status": 0
    }
  ]
}

